{"body":{"text":["**The author's review of the components and the chassis,** begun in the twenty-second session: the pill and the list plain, each component naming its code in its holon, the query the browser's address through the location, the components a store of their own (22/3 to 22/44); next the chassis kept apart from its renderer, each concern a file of its own (22/9, 22/10; the path The chassis apart from its renderer), and the rest of the glue. *Open: the thread The components' remaining glue.*"]},"id":"1M88X9294ER5000","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**Input, layers and overlays:** the root reserving gestures and input otherwise the components', a gesture passed up the holarchy until captured, the context menu matching over where it was pressed, and an overlay layer for it and for completion (23/23 to 23/29), with chrome, nested chassis and accessibility beside them; the git integration may come first, as the author weighs (23/27). *Open: the threads named under Components.*"]},"id":"1M88X9294ER5001","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**The old wiki's fate:** whether The wiki, kept as it stood, is let go, as the author leaned to if Knowledge holds all it does (18/105), and whether the reasoning it alone holds comes into Knowledge first. *Open, awaiting the author.*"]},"id":"1M88X9294ER5002","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**Fewer passes to the stores:** \"I would thikn it shouldn t need many passes to the store if we have the right native vocabulary\" (19/72). A brief is now read in one read, and what a read applies learned a layer at a time, each function it names asked whole (20/16, 20/34); it is still learned every read, and knowing it across reads would be the engine keeping something, a deeper discussion the author set apart: \"architecturally, that's not what we drew\" (20/11). The reads of a page run again on each move of the query, where the author holds only reads receiving a change should (21/77); re-deriving only where a change flows is, he says, \"for the future … probably a requirement of an engine\" (21/90), the successor (21/96). *Open; the thread Reads re-derived where a change flows.*"]},"id":"1M88X9294ER5003","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**The git integration:** the linked code of holons seen, the repository's tree navigable as it is, one store on the start page (19/19); read-only first, as the session proposed."]},"id":"1M88X9294ER5004","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**Reading git from a browser, tested:** a repository served as plain files read from a page, with no proxy and no limit, before building on it (19/24)."]},"id":"1M88X9294ER5005","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**The stores read through git,** locally and published alike, the build no longer copying them (19/21)."]},"id":"1M88X9294ER5006","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**Then the threads** standing open, divergence first among them: when a commit lands in some stores it touches and misses others, the holons it wrote marked diverged, the later commit's version found to answer, and the share not delivered kept while the engine lives, as settled at 12/77. *Open: where the mark is kept, and so whether a read may then ask for a holon only where holding says it lies; the threads Where divergence is marked, Where a holon is kept and Holding links to history.*"]},"id":"1M88X9294ER5007","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**Stopping a store:** the store contract has no way to let a store go; the location listens only while subscribed, but strata keeps its files and timers (22/19, 22/20). A clear task for the near future, at the author's word (22/19). *Open: the thread Stopping a store.*"]},"id":"1M88X9294ER5008","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**Addresses through a store's identity:** an address and a dependency begin at a mount's local name, where a reference by id names no store, the two behaving differently, as the author asked and the session confirmed (22/41, 22/42). The session proposed a store's identity its root's id, addresses and dependencies to resolve through it, and following an id to whatever store holds it as right (22/40), *Proposed*; the author asked of the long run, \"Thinking about the absolute future, not a pilot phase\", and held, of a store gone and another mounted with the same holon, that \"it makes sense though that it doesn't automagically point to the new place\" (22/39). *Open: the thread Addresses through a store's identity.*"]},"id":"1M88X9294ER5009","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**The command line able to commit,** so the field is written through the engine by hand and the author's tools in `author/` go. *The tools going, settled 2026-11-11.*"]},"id":"1M88X9294ER500A","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**Holons read as the type asked,** as the buffer of characters is read as a string."]},"id":"1M88X9294ER500B","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["*The engine, the interface and the stores were merged onto main and the site published (19/25); the expressions as uses, the buffer, the interface and the site on the engine, the stores in strata and components declared in their holons, the steps before these, are built, as each part says. The chassis was broken away at the author's word (20/19), and the components made plain functions over `io`, rendered and laid out by it (21/57, 21/72), built; the author's review of them began in the twenty-second session (22/3), the location built as the first integration and the components given a store of their own (22/44); in the twenty-third session the author considered how input, the context menu and overlays are to work, and held a card only a card (23/21, 23/29); the chassis apart from its renderer is next, then input, layers and overlays or the git integration (19/19, 23/27). The order is the session's. Proposed.*"]},"id":"1M88X9294ER500C","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
